[en.FOCUS_C15_MILITARY_RECOVERY]
Revive the Army

[en.FOCUS_C15_MILITARY_RECOVERY_desc]
Martialism is the noble tradition of the Crystal Empire, but now, the Crystal Empire is bound by various treaties and cannot develop its military. Obviously, in order to revive the Crystal Empire, it is necessary to revive the army.\nHowever, the Changelings will not peacefully watch the Crystal Empire rebuild its army, so they will definitely try to obstruct it.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_MILITARY_RECOVERY]
重振军队

[zh.FOCUS_C15_MILITARY_RECOVERY_desc]
尚武精神是水晶帝国的高贵传统，但如今，水晶帝国被各种条约所束缚，无法再发展军事。很显然，想要复兴水晶帝国，就必须重振军队。\n然而，幻形灵不可能眼睁睁的看着水晶帝国重建军队，所以，他们一定会尝试阻挠。

